Module emit normal
Entry and exit pointer on cell sixty four
One sweep moves the cursor forward one element and writes the byte under the cursor
A dollar sign under the cursor pauses and keeps the cursor there with status one
The newline before the end line stops the body with status two and writes nothing
The status is carried to cell seventy four by the walk back to the HOME marker

